    {
     "tool_call_id": "call_9170fcf2a2aa4b5c8cc2da41",
     "function_name": "agent",
     "arguments": {
      "description": "Find password/PIN UI code",
      "prompt": "Search the codebase in /home/antu_shared/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/qwen_original_run1/bug-1214 for files related to password or PIN setting, particularly:\n1. Files with \"password\" or \"pin\" in their name\n2. XML layout files related to password/PIN entry or confirmation\n3. Java/Kotlin files that handle password setting, confirmation, and visibility toggling\n\nThe bug is about a \"Confirm password\" field not reacting when the \"show password\" visibility icon is tapped. Look for code that handles password visibility toggling and confirm password fields.\n\nBe thorough - search for patterns like \"confirm\", \"password\", \"pin\", \"visibility\", \"toggle\", \"show password\" in both layout XML files and source code.",
